## #03 - actual prepare-record-render-read path
From an exact source page/pass, declared agreement and the shared descriptor:
verify/read task and return -> derive a decision template/registration -> accept
Prime-supplied typed judgment -> commit review record -> render the FULL assessment
under N5NN/05.NN -> new-process read recovers the supplied next action/questions.
N7NN uses its own 06.NN.review tail. Do not reduce reviews to evidence-only pointers.
No invented judgment, approval or work closure. Preserve all source wording and
Director replies. Preserve outside-section bytes and substantive prior reviews.
If record commit succeeds but render fails, expose render-pending/conflict and an
idempotent recovery operation; never lose the judgment or falsely report full success.
No requirement to wait for Grok-1's unfinished tool. Use honest synthetic descriptor
fixtures conforming to the frozen seam, plus a declared adapter for later real data.

